{
  "_why": "Error-states batch 1 before/after deck (2026-09-11). Every failure is a workbench-only override or URL switch (?fail=, ?update=available); nothing real is touched. Expectations accept the old OR the new wording so both runs verify; the deck compares the pictures. Fresh page per shot resets overrides.",
  "base": "http://127.0.0.1:5233/?mode=workbench&child=1&latency=0&scenario=default",
  "width": 1440,
  "height": 900,
  "pre": [
    {
      "eval": "if(new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('mode')!=='workbench'||!new URLSearchParams(location.search).has('child')) throw new Error('Mock injection requires child workbench'); /* WHY: mock namespaces are get-only catch-all proxies, so assigning one method is dropped. Wrap each namespace with a local override map. */ for(const ns of ['sync','session','native','artifacts','providers','skills','tags','update']){const original=window.claude[ns], overrides={};window.claude[ns]=new Proxy(original,{get:(t,k)=>Object.hasOwn(overrides,k)?overrides[k]:Reflect.get(t,k),set:(_t,k,v)=>{overrides[k]=v;return true;}});} window.seen=(...parts)=>parts.some(p=>document.body.innerText.includes(p));"
    }
  ],
